---
import PostLayout from '../../layouts/PostLayout.astro';
---

<PostLayout
  pageTitle="Andaman Sands | Expeditions"
  heroTitle="Andaman<br>Sands"
  heroSubtitle="Glimpses of Thailand 2018"
  seriesLabel="Thailand &mdash; Vol. I"
  heroStyle="background-image: url('https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/08.jpg')"
  date="JANUARY 7TH, 2019"
  location="Phuket, Thailand"
  footnote="A shout-out to long-planned good times with good friends &mdash; Bhaskar, Umang, Gravy and Shivam. Prost! &copy; Zubin John"
  moreTitle="More Expeditions"
  description="Phuket sunsets, rock pools, and island hopping to Ko Phi Phi on Thailand's Andaman coast. January 2019."
>
  <Fragment slot="nav-left">Thailand</Fragment>
  <a slot="nav-right" class="back-btn" href="/expeditions/">&#8592; All Expeditions</a>

  <!-- INTRO -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="text">
      <p class="lede">
        Wheels down, Thailand. The unremarkable: touchdown, customs, short-flight, quick-shower, Patong nights.
        Day 2, the scene is set to explore the pristine sands and sunsets of Phuket, pearl of Thailand's
        Andaman coast.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: WHEELS DOWN -->
  <section class="space-sm">
    <div class="text">
      <h2 class="section-title">Wheels Down, Thailand</h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2-UP: Arrival (10, 09) -->
  <section class="space-md" style="padding-bottom:0;">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/10.jpg" alt="Beach with palm trees and birds, Phuket" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/09.jpg" alt="Rocky shoreline and turquoise sea, Phuket" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="text" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <figcaption>Pearl of the Andaman coast. The beach at midday and the same horizon a few hours later.</figcaption>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SINGLE: Arrival (08) -->
  <section class="space-md" style="padding-top:28px;">
    <div class="single">
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/08.jpg" alt="Sunset over dark rocks and the Andaman Sea, Phuket" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PARALLAX: Pastel Sunsets (text over the photo, edges fade into the page) -->
  <style is:inline>
    .parallax-section{ position:relative; min-height:72vh; display:flex; align-items:center; background:center/cover no-repeat fixed; }
    .parallax-section::before{ content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background:rgba(0,0,0,.42); }
    .parallax-inner{ position:relative; z-index:1; width:100%; max-width:var(--page); margin:0 auto; padding:0 var(--gutter); }
    .parallax-inner .text{ padding:0; }
    .parallax-section .section-title{ color:#fff; }
    .parallax-section p{ color:rgba(255,255,255,.92); }
    @media (max-width:768px){ .parallax-section{ min-height:60vh; background-attachment:scroll; } }
  </style>
  <section class="parallax-section" style="background-image:url('https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/06.jpg')">
    <div class="parallax-inner">
      <div class="text">
        <h2 class="section-title">Pastel Sunsets</h2>
        <p>Turning your eyes west to an unspoiled horizon spills its reward in a scintillating climax to the day's activity. The sight awaits...</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SPLIT: Rock pools (text left, solo photo right) -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="text">
        <h2 class="section-title">Fortuitous Rock Pools</h2>
        <p>
          A chance seaside natural rock pool beckons the weary traveller with the promise of a cool respite and
          a captivating vista. Do not underestimate the calming effects of a quick sunset dip &mdash; but look
          out for exposed oyster shells. They have been known to ruin quite a few happy tourists' days.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/07.jpg" alt="Splash in a sunlit Phuket rock pool" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: DIVING IN -->
  <section class="space-sm" style="padding-top:44px;">
    <div class="text">
      <h2 class="section-title">Speaking of diving in..</h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2+1: Diving in (03, 04 top, 05 full width) -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2plus1">
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/03.jpg" alt="Limestone cliffs and turquoise water, Phuket" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/04.jpg" alt="Long-tail boat on turquoise water with a diver, Andaman Sea" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure class="span-2">
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/05.jpg" alt="Swimmer floating in clear turquoise water, Andaman Sea" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="text" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <figcaption>
        The iconic limestone karsts of Ko Phi Phi Don and Ko Phi Phi Le &mdash; everything the brochure promised
        and then some.
      </figcaption>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: OPEN SEA -->
  <section class="space-sm" style="padding-top:44px;">
    <div class="text">
      <h2 class="section-title">Day 3 on the Open Sea</h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-sm">
    <div class="text">
      <p>
        A trip to coastal Thailand is incomplete without the cliched yet essential island-hopping boat tours.
        Set yourself for a day of sun, spray and authentic Thai entertainment. Kick back and enjoy the bumpy
        ride as the tour guides regale you with their flavour of pop-culture-infused history of the island
        locals.
      </p>
      <p>
        A few boat stops along the likes of Ko Phi Phi Don and Ko Phi Phi Le and our trip to the coast
        concludes &mdash; shuttle ride back to the hotel, eyes set on Bangkok.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2-UP: Open sea (02, 01) -->
  <section class="space-md">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/02.jpg" alt="Turquoise waters between islands, Ko Phi Phi Le" /></div>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <div class="media"><img src="https://media.bifunctional.xyz/expeditions/andaman/01.jpg" alt="Panoramic view of Maya Bay from the cliffs above, Ko Phi Phi Le" /></div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="text" style="margin-top:14px;">
      <figcaption>
        Maya Bay, Ko Phi Phi Le. Notoriously crowded on a map, unexpectedly serene in person.
      </figcaption>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MORE CARDS -->
  <Fragment slot="more-cards">
    <a class="more-card" href="/expeditions/bangkok/">
      <div class="more-thumb"></div>
      <p class="more-card-title">Bangkok Airwaves</p>
      <span class="more-card-badge">Published &mdash; Mar 2019</span>
      <p class="more-card-sub">Wat Pho, Wat Arun, Phra Nakhon district</p>
    </a>
    <a class="more-card" href="/expeditions/innsbruck/">
      <div class="more-thumb"></div>
      <p class="more-card-title">Into the Alps: Innsbruck</p>
      <span class="more-card-badge">Published &mdash; Oct 2021</span>
      <p class="more-card-sub">Altstadt, Nordkette, and Castle Ambras</p>
    </a>
    <a class="more-card" href="/expeditions/">
      <div class="more-thumb" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
        <span style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(3,43,34,.4);">All Expeditions</span>
      </div>
      <p class="more-card-title">View All</p>
      <span class="more-card-badge">Expeditions Index</span>
      <p class="more-card-sub">Alps, Italy, and more coming soon</p>
    </a>
  </Fragment>
</PostLayout>
